# Villainous Syndication: a tapped Villain cannot pay "Tap an untapped Villain you control" - on turn 1, with the Serpent
# Specialist tapped for the first activation, the second may tap only the Aerial Doombot. And with no creature card in
# Bot1's graveyard (it mills only Islands), the fourth plan counter sacrifices the enchantment but the reflexive ability
# has nothing to target and is removed from the stack (CR 603.3d, 603.12): nothing returns.

